# Copy to .env and fill in. Vite inlines VITE_* values at build time.
#
# Web3Forms access key — get one free at https://web3forms.com by entering the
# address that should receive the enquiries (Bella's own inbox is the right
# choice). The key is not a secret: Web3Forms expects it in the client, and it
# is locked to the address it was issued for.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=